name: sim.removePointsFromPointCloud
description: Removes points from a point cloud. When a point cloud doesn't use an OC tree calculation structure, then individual points cannot be removed, only all points can be removed in that case
luaSynopsis: int totalPointCnt = sim.removePointsFromPointCloud(int pointCloudHandle, int options, list points, float tolerance)
pythonSynopsis: int totalPointCnt = sim.removePointsFromPointCloud(int pointCloudHandle, int options, float[] points, float tolerance)
inputs:
1. pointCloudHandle: handle of the point cloud
2. options: bit-coded:
    - bit0 set (1): specified points are relative to the point cloud reference frame, otherwise they are relative to the world reference frame
3. points: point positions specified as x/y/z coordinates. Set to None/nil to remove all points
4. tolerance: distance used as a tolerance value
outputs:
1. totalPointCnt: total number of points in the point cloud
replacedBy:
- name: subtractPoints, class: pointCloud, file: pointCloud_subtractPoints.method
- name: subtractPackedPoints, class: pointCloud, file: pointCloud_subtractPackedPoints.method
- name: clear, class: pointCloud, file: pointCloud_clear.method
